{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53996","headline":"十二时歌 一 · 从谂","name":"十二时歌 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鷄鸣丑，愁见起来还漏逗。\n裙子褊（《偈颂》作「偏」）衫个也无，袈裟形相些些有。\n裩无腰（一作「裆」），袴无口，头上青灰三五斗。\n比望（一作「本爲」）修行利济人，谁知变作（一作「翻成」）不唧溜。\n（按：宋圆悟《碧岩录》卷四仰山引此首，注「一作」者爲其异文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"从谂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53996.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53996","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}